About the role
Hi
{formtext: name=hiring manager; default=Scott}
,
This is
{formtext: name=candidate}
. I am interested in applying for a role at Blaze.
I am particularly interested because,
{formmenu: I love tackling difficult engineering and product problems; I want my work to help a lot of people; I am a builder who wants a small, high-performance team; Other:; multiple=yes; name=reasons}
{if: includes(reasons, "Other:")}{formparagraph: name=Reasons I ❤️ Blaze}{endif}
I am not going to waste your time sending you a long CV of buzzwords, but I did want to share this one awesome thing I built. It's
{formtext: name=project description}
. And you can check it out at
{formtext: name=project link}
.
Anyways, I would love to chat with you
{formtext: name=hiring manager}
and learn more about Blaze.
Kind regards,
{formtext: name=candidate}
P.S. I read up on the capabilities of Blaze and I found these pages particularly helpful: <
https://blaze.today/guides/formulas/
>, <
https://blaze.today/formulas/blocks/
>. I built a snippet implementing a
{formmenu: game; app; todo-list; very cool thing}
. Check it out here:
{formparagraph: name=my snippet}
AboutText Blaze
Text Blaze saves time and increases comms quality by automating repeated tasks. Users save smart templates and insert them anywhere on the web using keyboard shortcuts. Templates can include placeholders, logic, dynamic fields, integrations with other apps, and more.
